    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.poster.avif?t=1731275541\" width=628 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.webm?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.mp4?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this game, you\u2019ll drag various blocks onto the board, filling rows or columns to clear them and score points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.poster.avif?t=1731275541\" width=620 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.webm?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.mp4?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the classic puzzle fun while racing against the clock to achieve the highest score possible. Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned pro, there's fun and challenge waiting for you!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li><strong>Simple and enjoyable elimination experience</strong><br>\tEnjoy the joy of quick elimination and continuous combos.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Undo feature</strong><br>\tPlaced a crucial block wrong by mistake? Try using the undo feature.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Different game modes</strong><br>\tExperience various gameplay modes, each offering its own unique feel.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Different game themes</strong><br>\tSwitch between different themes and choose your favorite art style to play in. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Collectible junk encyclopedia</strong><br>\tA wide variety of junk items will randomly appear\u2014collect them and enrich your encyclopedia. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Personal leaderboard</strong><br>\tYour best scores will be recorded\u2014keep improving your skills and witness your growth. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Simple controls</strong><br>\tEnjoy the game easily with just mouse clicks and drags.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.poster.avif?t=1731275541\" width=628 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.webm?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/369052ae2da8f5e8375906f0f53eb978.mp4?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this game, you\u2019ll drag various blocks onto the board, filling rows or columns to clear them and score points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.poster.avif?t=1731275541\" width=620 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.webm?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902260/extras/91d7d280d100a2ae69f9b21990f8c8dc.mp4?t=1731275541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the classic puzzle fun while racing against the clock to achieve the highest score possible. Whether you're a casual player or a seasoned pro, there's fun and challenge waiting for you!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\t<li><strong>Simple and enjoyable elimination experience</strong><br>\tEnjoy the joy of quick elimination and continuous combos.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Undo feature</strong><br>\tPlaced a crucial block wrong by mistake? Try using the undo feature.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Different game modes</strong><br>\tExperience various gameplay modes, each offering its own unique feel.<br>\t</li><li><strong>Different game themes</strong><br>\tSwitch between different themes and choose your favorite art style to play in. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Collectible junk encyclopedia</strong><br>\tA wide variety of junk items will randomly appear\u2014collect them and enrich your encyclopedia. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Personal leaderboard</strong><br>\tYour best scores will be recorded\u2014keep improving your skills and witness your growth. <br>\t</li><li><strong>Simple controls</strong><br>\tEnjoy the game easily with just mouse clicks and drags.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a relaxing and casual puzzle elimination game. Drag blocks onto the board to fill rows or columns and clear them. Watch out for &quot;junk&quot; blocks that obstruct progress and require match-three combos to remove. Use your skills to achieve high scores and test your mental limits!",
